{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-18_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-18","title":"血潮翻涌","storyCode":"13-20","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-18_end.txt","sourceHash":"75cb472e96fa38e745177b4a9d631e9304cd4e6b867a5cf20d62129178785281","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无趣的行为。\n你以为这可以激怒我，这可以侮辱我？\n\\n你以为我会气急败坏地踹开你的尸体，大骂你的僭越？\n我不会，莱托。勒内·莱托。\n\\n微不足道的人啊......一如我眼中的这片大地，令人腻烦。\n你以为你的所作所为，可以赋予你可悲的一生以意义？\n\\n你还是这么自视甚高，莱托。\n\\n我不会为你停留，哪怕一瞬的目光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g1_shard_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我的印象没错的话，我在你的那个虚伪的“军事委员会”里，似乎也有个职务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你是不是已经很久没有送战报给我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"是你太久没有出席军事委员会的相关会议了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直拥有相应的指挥权。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“指挥权”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要指挥我的子嗣们，他们天生就归于我，归于他们侍奉的王庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你需要更好地看管他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"战争的终局已经临近，你的部属需要发挥更重要的作用，他们的肆意妄为让我厌烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"西线战场花费了太多时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是仪式的需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果没有足够的血与泪，我们又怎么能积攒这么多的巫术材料呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和特蕾西娅向我声称，你们找到了那一扇遍结疮痂的、古老的门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹苦难的源头，命运的起点，真的就在那扇门之后吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"仪式的准备已经完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"但其中的一个节点，那座叫布伦特伍德的镇子，正在被我们的敌人进攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在指派我为你解决这些小麻烦吗，特雷西斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，您倒是提醒我了，军事委员会德高望重的“摄政王”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然军事委员会记得那么一个“关键”的城镇，为何并无像样的布防？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裹缠尸布的术师，骨肉傀儡，或是随便什么巫术加持、挥舞皮肉的莽汉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我纵容你和你的妹妹，因你们的灵魂强大耀眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"软弱的萨卡兹会称呼你为摄政王，赦罪师们簇拥在你的身边，还为你带回了特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摄政王，死而复归的“魔王”，你们是一对有趣的兄妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，这都是因为，你们的举止、力量，而不是你的......“地位”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"“力量”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了降下最宏伟的诅咒，我已在这片战场上布下赐福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为最古老的王庭之一，我仁慈地唤起萨卡兹们血脉中本就潜藏的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，特雷西斯，你感受到了吗？你为我的恩赐而喜悦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你那驳杂的血液中，又能被沥起几分力量呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"终局将近，让你心浮气躁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"藏好你的弱点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"或者说，你需要一些提醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会为你完成仪式的最后一部分，高傲的摄政王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这不是为了你们兄妹那狭小的雄心壮志，你们总是盯着那座拥有卡兹戴尔虚名的移动城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只算得上痛楚的长河中的又一个歇脚处罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅已经准备好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"这座碎片大厦也将发挥出维多利亚永远也设想不到的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"那具骸骨正在城外军营下的枢纽中等待，你可以从那里前往布伦特伍德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......令人兴奋，不是吗？特雷西斯，你总是这么一张了无生气的面孔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经看见了。从地平线那头腾起的黑色光芒，像是一堵黑曜石墙，终将堆砌真正的城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。你笑我急躁，可沉默不正是你遮掩内心的最佳手段吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿我还来得及回来，目睹那番盛况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若你真的能找回那种足以重塑这片大地的伟力，萨卡兹最初接触到的......“源石”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我会为你，把卡兹戴尔的名号，铺满我将触及的每片土地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨卡兹，我的同胞们，背弃自己的过往太久了。\n\\n他们愤恨，他们怨诅，他们将报复施加于我们的敌人之身。\n多么让人失望。\n\\n我的同胞们甚至忘记了血脉的来源，忘记了先祖的名讳。\n\\n他们在麻木与悲哀中交媾，诞下一代代丑陋的、混血的子孙。\n\\n他们把自己投入移动城市的阴影之中，藏身于街巷，从侵略者手中乞食。\n我对维多利亚人的血越发失去兴致，我对满足于此的萨卡兹们......则更加怒其不争。\n\\n萨卡兹自称萨卡兹的那一刻起，接受了这个“世界”异化他们的那一刻起——\n\\n就让人怒不可遏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君阁下，巨兽的漂航即将结束，我们很快就会抵达布伦特伍德附近的停靠站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那座小镇已经被维多利亚人攻陷，您的造物也正被他们清扫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......造物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些无智的虫豸，不过是鲜血王庭的子裔们为晶石涂画咒文时，无意间洒下的几滴残血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就让维多利亚人去庆祝他们的“胜利”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我误会了，抱歉，阁下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我看了眼这位军事委员会的少校，萨卡兹。\n\\n特雷西斯在他建立的这套系统里，布置了这么多游荡在王庭之外的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫厄尔苏拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的血液中掺杂了太多酒精，我原谅贪婪与享乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你的犹疑，让人失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以为你洗去它们，“少校”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感谢您的好意，血魔大君阁下，我自己......能处理。我......会尽力改正。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她因紧张而低下头颅。\n\\n但至少，这些混血儿们还懂得抗争，这能稍微弥补他们的愚昧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄尔苏拉......厄尔苏拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窃取时间的厄尔苏拉。家喻户晓的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，“厄尔苏拉”居然挽起了这具骸骨的缰绳，小小的风趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下，这只是个巧合。我在为自己起名时，从未料到会真的如英雄一般——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄尔苏拉是个懦夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他甚至无法直视这只巨兽的双眼，只敢躲藏在它激起的乱流中，摇醒几个沉湎于幻象的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我派给了他这样的任务，当然了，“拯救了很多人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空洞的呢喃声传来，回荡在整个空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你终于认出我了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一片死寂。\n\\n它的智识早已被剥离，如今剩下的只不过是个徒留反应的空壳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君阁下，我们即将抵达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能会有一些幻觉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必提醒我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与它曾打的交道，远比你多得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"灰白色的卡兹戴尔被炎魔葬送。\n\\n焚迹碾过所有氏族的营帐。\n\\n我能听见火焰的怒吼，我能听见火焰的哀恸。\n为什么我们还在屈服！为什么我们还在懦弱！\n\\n你们这就满足了吗？\n\\n你们这就满足了吗？！\n\\n那我，就代替你们——\n废墟中，古老的同胞跪地哭泣。\n\\n魔王死了。\n\\n魔王杀死了魔王。\n\\n我知道他不过是涟漪中的幻象。\n\\n我知道这就是我们不可改写的历史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的萨卡兹语）你们费尽心血地建起了这座灰白色的卡兹戴尔，萨卡兹再一次拥有了家园。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的萨卡兹语）可你们不曾为它的狭小愤怒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的萨卡兹语）异族的侵略让提卡兹失去了故乡。于是，你们开始退让，你们把代表家园之物一次次缩小、歪曲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的萨卡兹语）直到一片平原，直到一圈围场，直到你们只敢用它来称呼自己的城市，自己的村庄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的萨卡兹语）这是萨卡兹软弱的起点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的萨卡兹语）而如今，我将在终点前回望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻境结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这具骸骨已经游回了巢穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......血魔大君阁下，我有责任提醒您，那支控制了布伦特伍德核心法阵的部队仍在附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们对骸骨会留下航迹并非一无所知，我们的归来恐怕已经暴露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的力量不容置疑，但那些敌人中，也许有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的敌人毁去了仪式的节点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这具骸骨在战场上投下的那些法阵，本就只是猩红王庭的触须末端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罢了，既然已达终末......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，就由我亲自作为这场最古老的仪式的中心——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"朝阳正在升起，透过停靠站上的破损的岩洞，第一缕血色的霞光已经洒下。\n\\n新的一日。\n\\n但这一日，将与以往所有悲哀的日子截然不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“远逐者”啊，戴冠的猎手，我们的第一位魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若您万年前的魂灵仍宿于众魂之中——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"名为碎片大厦的高塔之上，已经积累了足够的阴云。\n\\n愚蠢的维多利亚人却只把这风暴当作可供投掷的长枪。\n\\n多么浅薄，他们天生败坏的习性里，只有争斗。\n我闭上眼睛，感受着那些血色晶簇构成的法阵，感受着自这场战争以来——不，自我们自贬为萨卡兹以来，所有曾流淌于这片大地上的血液。\n\\n它们因我的垂怜而颤抖，它们因我的呼唤而沸腾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若您仍然注视着我们，注视着您家园沦丧的后代......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若那些被一次次扭曲、涂抹的渺远的传说并非虚假——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请让那摇篮中的苦难再度降临。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请让我们......再度寻回提卡兹已失落的命运。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一滴鲜血自我的眼眶滑落。\n\\n它流淌于我的面庞。\n......\n\\n......\n如此遥远的声音，它在回应着我。\n\\n我仿佛已经能触摸到它。\n\\n那扇早已被尘烟埋没的门扉，正在缓缓松动。\n\\n伦蒂尼姆的风暴，正奏响新生的乐章。\n\\n嗯，似乎，还差些什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如我们所料，维多利亚人正在对这里发动进攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会尽可能地为您争取完成仪式的时间，血魔大君阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚人？呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯，你真是给我留了一个惊喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不，名叫厄尔苏拉的姑娘，我们要面对的，可不是什么“维多利亚人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的客人，确实配得上见证这一刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一位血脉纯净之人，尚且稚幼的丧钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，被篡夺的“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不论是谁，军事委员会的计划都必须被贯彻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会加强自己与巨兽的联系，竭尽所能阻止他们抵达这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君阁下，请您——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还没有资格向我提出建议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我真想看看——他们这次又会向我吐出什么陈词滥调，他们又能向我展示什么绝望的瞬间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，“少校”，留在这里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的这份可有可无的工作，已经结束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这些空洞的骸骨，已经有多少年未曾被填充了？四百年，还是五百年？\n那时，我还未成为鲜血王庭的主人。\n\\n那时，我还能听见腐烂的战争之王傲慢的呢喃，听见笞心垩主挥向夜幕的拷打。\n\\n那时，哪怕血魔曾与他们敌对，这些翻涌着憎意与信仰的强大的灵魂，仍让我感到心潮澎湃。\n\\n那时的萨卡兹，已是无家可归的散乱族群。但那时，我还能看见些许，骄傲灵魂的残余。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“破灭”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血海吞噬咒言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还在玩弄这些可悲的文辞，虚假的咒言，女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不去正视那些，真正属于你的，真正积淀在你血脉之中的权力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所能唱响的挽歌，现在难道不是应该更动听了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你却缄默，你却，“从不开口”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们到底在试图与什么连接？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这绝不是任何一种存在于萨卡兹文献记载中的仪式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正在被唤醒的，那是......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......我看见的，是......一枚“种子”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......你们在用万年前的巫术叩醒它，用战场上的法阵滋养它，用碎片大厦的风暴驾驭它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这绝不能被允许！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们会彻底毁了伦蒂尼姆！那里会沦为仅余源石的废都！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不止如此......这样的规模，这样的力量......我甚至能看到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的复仇把整个泰拉拖入深渊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“复仇”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，你仍声称你是萨卡兹的魔王，可你的观点却又是这么地充斥偏见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两百年前，泰拉诸国的联军毁去过一次卡兹戴尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而现在，你觉得，我们将维多利亚的首都献给痛苦与毁灭，只是为了还击两百年前他们对我们的征服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......又一次令人失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑王冠仍停留于你的头顶，这确实是“魔王”做出的，又一件荒唐的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀死一个敌人与屠戮一个国家，葬送一座城市与抹去一种文化，这些都没有区别，对于萨卡兹，这些都远不足以称得上反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们来到伦蒂尼姆这座异族的首都，也从来不是为了这种“还击”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“种子”？不错的描述。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看着那颗种子会带来什么样的光景吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偏狭的人是你，血魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何一种花言巧语，都无法改变你们所行之事的本质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说我“从不开口”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，你会听见的，血魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“缚结，重枷落于你的躯骸。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"漆黑的王冠浮现于异族的头顶。\n\\n漆黑的长矛贯穿我的肩胛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会，这么简单——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不，不对！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"啊......鲜血涌出。魔王为我裂开了伤口。\n\\n这些是我和我的先祖们，精心传承了万年的鲜血。\n我细心地从中拣选着。\n\\n鲜血王庭的历任主人，都需日复一日，抚去血中哪怕一丝杂质。\n\\n但我们之所以纯净，并不是因为这支血脉未曾失落，未曾受辱。\n\\n而是因为——\n我终于找到它了。\n\\n一滴血。\n\\n历经万年时光，传承至今的——\n\\n提卡兹的血。\n土地为此缄默，河流为此停滞，空气为此哀鸣。\n\\n整个世界，为此肃穆。\n\\n随着我伸出的手掌，它缓缓漂浮到了我的身前，它并未滴落。\n\\n它只是，向上，向上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他的血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他想完成仪式的最后一步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"提卡兹的血寂灭于世界之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！留在伦蒂尼姆的咒文在方才那个刹那崩毁无迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伦蒂尼姆发生了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，尽快结束战斗，我感到某种——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么匆忙，客人们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血液在骸骨之上蠕行——\n\\n血痕于枯朽之中析出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚巧有一个这么好的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在最初的诅咒的见证下——也许我们今日......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还能送别，最后一任“魔王”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
